hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1139","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aadmi Musalman shakhs ko aazaad karey to Allah uskey har uzw key badley uska har uzw aag se bacha lega. (Bukhari: 2517)"
"1140","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kaunsa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par imaan aur uskey raastey mein jihaad. Main ne kaha: Phir kaunsi gardan afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Uskey paas sab se zyada qeemat wali aur uskey ghar walon key paas sab se nafces. Main ne kaha: Phir agar main na karun? Aap ne farmaya: Zaaya honay waley ki madad karo ya be-hunar key liye banao. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir agar main na karun? Aap ne farmaya: Logon ko buraai se chhoro, beshak wo sadqa hai jo tum apne aap par sadqa kartey ho. (Bukhari: 2518)"
"1141","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulaam mein apna hissa aazaad karey aur uskey paas maal ho jo ghulaam ki qeemat ko pahunchey to ghulaam par munaasib qeemat lagaai jaaeygi. To wo apne shareekon ko unkey hissey deyga aur us par ghulaam aazaad ho jaaeyga. Warna us mein se utna aazaad hua jitna aazaad hua."
"1142","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri wajah se meri ummat se us se darguzar kya hai jo uskey seeney waswasa daalein jab tak wo amal na karey ya baat na karey. (Bukhari: 2528)"
"1143","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo jab Islam laaney ka iraada kar key aey aur unkey sath unka ghulaam tha to un mein se har aik apne saathi se gum ho gaya. To uskey baad wo aey jabke Abu Hurairah Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baithey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Ye tumhara ghulaam tumharey paas aaya hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Khabardaar! Beshak main tumhey gawaah banaata hun ke wo aazaad hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo us waqt keh raha hai: Ae lambi raat, uski lambaai aur uski thakaan, is par ke wo kufr key ghar se najaat paa gai. (Bukhari: 2530)"
"1144","[AI-translation] Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne jaahiliyat mein sau gardanein aazaad kein aur sau oonton par sawaar kya. Phir jab wo Musalman huey to sau oonton par sawaar kya aur sau gardanein aazaad kein. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bataaiye aisi cheezein jo main jaahiliyat mein karta tha, jin se main neki samajhta tha, yaani un se bhalai karta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum pehli bhalai key sath Musalman huey ho. (Bukhari: 2538)"
"1145","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani Mustaliq par hamla kya jabke wo ghaafil they aur unkey maweshi paani par pilaey jaa rahey they. To unkey ladney walon ko qatl kya aur unki aulaad ko qaidi banaaya. Aur us din Juwairiya (haath aaein). (Bukhari: 2541)"
"1146","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Bani Tameem se mohabbat karta raha, teen (baaton) se jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unkey baarey mein sunein. Main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Wo Dajjaal par meri ummat mein sab se sakht hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur unkey sadqey aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye hamaari qaum key sadqey hain. Aur un mein se qaidi Aisha key paas thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Use aazaad karo, beshak wo Ismail ki aulaad mein se hai. (Bukhari: 2543)"
"1147","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi na kahey: Apne Rab ko khilao, apne Rab ko wuzu karao, apne Rab ko pilaao. Aur kahey: Merey sardaar, merey aaqa! Aur tum mein se koi na kahey: Mera banda, meri londi! Aur kahey: Mera ladka aur meri ladki aur mera ghulaam! (Bukhari: 2552)"
"1148","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Jab tum mein se kisi key paas uska khaadim uska khaana laaey to agar wo use apne sath na bithaaey to use luqma ya do luqmaey dey. Ya khaana ya do khaaney. Beshak us ne uska ilaaj kya hai. (Bukhari: 2557)"
"1149","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi ladey to chehrey se bachey. Kitaabat waley ki kitaab."
"1150","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Barira uskey paas uski kitaabat mein madad maangney aai jabke us ne apni kitaabat mein se kuchh ada na kya tha. Aisha ne us se kaha: Apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jao. Phir agar wo pasand karein ke main tumhaari kitaabat tumhaari taraf se ada karun aur tumhaari walaa merey liye ho to karungi. To Barira ne uska apne ghar walon se zikr kya aur unhon-ne inkaar kya aur kaha: Agar wo chaahe ke tum par ehsaan karey to karey jabke tumhaari walaa hamaarey liye ho. To us ne uska Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Khareedo aur aazaad karo. Beshak walaa uskey liye hai jo aazaad karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur farmaya: Logon ka kya haal hai jo shartein lagaatey hain jo Allah ki Kitaab mein nahi hain. Jo shart lagaaey jo Allah ki Kitaab mein nahi hai to wo uskey liye nahi hai agarchey sau martaba shart lagaaey. Allah ki shart zyada haq aur mazboot hai. (Bukhari: 2561). Tohfa aur uska fazl aur uski targheeb ki kitaab."
